      "source": [
        "### Your observations:\n",
        "\n",
        "With all three features, the test RMSE is about **1.7816**. With only TV and Radio, the test RMSE is about **1.7714**. Since a lower RMSE means smaller prediction errors, removing Newspaper slightly improves predictions on this test set. This suggests Newspaper does not help much here and may add a little noise, though the difference is small and results can vary with the split."
      ]
    },
